WEBVTT

00:05:58.727 --> 00:06:00.830
Because, when I was in college,

00:06:00.854 --> 00:06:04.163
the Reverend Kelly Brown Douglas
was my mentor,

00:06:04.187 --> 00:06:07.226
and I knew that America Chavez
needed one, too.

00:06:09.513 --> 00:06:14.219
And who better to mentor
America Chavez than Storm,

00:06:14.243 --> 00:06:17.165
the first black female superhero

00:06:17.189 --> 00:06:19.950
and one of the most powerful
members of the X-Men?

00:06:20.786 --> 00:06:22.626
Nobody, that's who.

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:23.942
(Laughter)

00:06:24.263 --> 00:06:27.892
And Storm teaches America
how to quiet her mind

00:06:27.916 --> 00:06:29.875
inside of a star portal,

00:06:29.899 --> 00:06:33.295
and when America quiets her mind,
she opens up the dimensions,